<title>USA: Medical Industries names Kobrin CFO.</title>
<headline>Medical Industries names Kobrin CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BOYNTON BEACH, Fla. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Industries of America Inc said on Wednesday it named Arthur Kobrin its chief financial officer, replacing Dawn Drella.</p>
<p>Drella resigned to move to Chicago to be married, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>Kobrin previously was audit manager for Weinberg, Pershes &amp; Co PA.</p>
<p>Medical Industries provides diagnostic and therapeutic health-care services.</p>
</text>
